                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Right: Content -->
                    <div class="col-lg-9">

                        <!-- Introduction -->
                        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4" id="intro">
                            <div class="card-header bg-white fw-bold py-3 fs-5">
                                <i class="fa fa-info-circle me-2 text-success"/>Introduction
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <p>The <strong>Ameen Hub Provider API</strong> allows insurance companies to receive RFQ (Request for Quotation) requests and submit quotes programmatically — without using the web portal.</p>
                                <p>This is ideal for companies that want to automate quote generation from their own internal systems.</p>
                                <div class="o_pp_api_base">
                                    <div class="text-muted small mb-1">Base URL</div>
                                    <code><t t-esc="base_url"/>/insurance/provider/api</code>
                                </div>
                                <div class="alert alert-warning mt-3 mb-0">
                                    <i class="fa fa-shield me-2"/>All API requests must include your <strong>Bearer token</strong> in the Authorization header. Keep your token secret.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Authentication -->
                        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4" id="auth">
                            <div class="card-header bg-white fw-bold py-3 fs-5">
                                <i class="fa fa-lock me-2 text-success"/>Authentication
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <p>All requests require a <code>Bearer</code> token in the <code>Authorization</code> HTTP header.</p>
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN</pre>
                                <p class="mt-3">Alternatively, you can pass the token as a query parameter:</p>
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">GET /insurance/provider/api/rfqs?token=YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN</pre>
                                <t t-if="provider and token">
                                    <div class="alert alert-success mt-3">
                                        <strong>Your Access Token:</strong><br/>
                                        <code class="user-select-all"><t t-esc="token"/></code>
                                    </div>
                                </t>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- List RFQs -->
                        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4" id="list-rfqs">
                            <div class="card-header bg-white fw-bold py-3 fs-5">
                                <span class="badge bg-info me-2">GET</span>List Incoming RFQs
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">GET /insurance/provider/api/rfqs</pre>
                                <p class="mt-3"><strong>Response:</strong></p>
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">{
  "provider": "Al Ahlia Insurance",
  "count": 3,
  "rfqs": [
    {
      "id": 42,
      "reference": "RFQ/2026/00042",
      "insurance_type": "medical",
      "status": "sent",
      "sent_date": "2026-05-14",
      "response_deadline": "2026-05-19",
      "requirements": "Medical group insurance for 120 employees...",
      "quoted": false,
      "detail_url": "/insurance/provider/rfq/42?token=..."
    }
  ]
}</pre>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Submit Quote -->
                        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4" id="submit-quote">
                            <div class="card-header bg-white fw-bold py-3 fs-5">
                                <span class="badge bg-success me-2">POST</span>Submit a Quote
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">POST /insurance/provider/api/quote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN</pre>
                                <p class="mt-3"><strong>Request Body:</strong></p>
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">{
  "rfq_id": 42,
  "premium": 1250.500,
  "deductible": 100.000,
  "coverage": "Full comprehensive medical coverage including dental and optical",
  "exclusions": "Pre-existing conditions within first 6 months",
  "network": "NMC Healthcare Network",
  "add_ons": "Maternity coverage, dental, optical",
  "claim_settlement_ratio": 96.5,
  "validity_date": "2026-06-14",
  "notes": "Group discount applied for 120+ employees"
}</pre>
                                <p class="mt-3"><strong>Response (success):</strong></p>
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">{
  "success": true,
  "quote_id": 87,
  "message": "Quote submitted successfully"
}</pre>
                                <div class="alert alert-info mt-3 mb-0">
                                    <strong>Fields:</strong> Only <code>rfq_id</code> and <code>premium</code> are required. All other fields are optional but recommended.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Error Codes -->
                        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4" id="errors">
                            <div class="card-header bg-white fw-bold py-3 fs-5">
                                <i class="fa fa-exclamation-triangle me-2 text-success"/>Error Codes
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body p-0">
                                <table class="table mb-0">
                                    <thead class="table-light">
                                        <tr><th>HTTP Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                        <tr><td><code>401</code></td><td>Invalid or missing access token</td></tr>
                                        <tr><td><code>400</code></td><td>Missing required fields (rfq_id, premium)</td></tr>
                                        <tr><td><code>404</code></td><td>RFQ not found or not assigned to your company</td></tr>
                                        <tr><td><code>500</code></td><td>Server error — contact support</td></tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Code Examples -->
                        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4" id="examples">
                            <div class="card-header bg-white fw-bold py-3 fs-5">
                                <i class="fa fa-terminal me-2 text-success"/>Code Examples
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <p class="fw-semibold mb-2">Python (requests)</p>
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">import requests

TOKEN = "YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN"
BASE  = "<t t-esc="base_url"/>"

# List RFQs
resp = requests.get(f"{BASE}/insurance/provider/api/rfqs",
    headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {TOKEN}"})
rfqs = resp.json()["rfqs"]

# Submit a quote
requests.post(f"{BASE}/insurance/provider/api/quote",
    headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {TOKEN}",
             "Content-Type": "application/json"},
    json={
        "rfq_id": rfqs[0]["id"],
        "premium": 1250.500,
        "deductible": 100.0,
        "coverage": "Full comprehensive coverage",
        "claim_settlement_ratio": 96.5,
        "validity_date": "2026-06-14"
    })</pre>

                                <p class="fw-semibold mt-4 mb-2">cURL</p>
                                <pre class="o_pp_code_block">curl -X POST <t t-esc="base_url"/>/insurance/provider/api/quote \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"rfq_id":42,"premium":1250.5,"coverage":"Full coverage"}'</pre>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Support -->
